  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阮bē記--得--你"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>何明洲</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮bē記得你ê成績</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tio̍h等iah是退步</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kan-na ē記得你</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">tī光iānn-iānn ê大草埔　快樂sì-kè走</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮bē記得你ná山ê宿題</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">早早完成iah是拖拖沙沙</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kan-na ē記得你</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">體貼　善良　好性地</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮bē記得你考tiâu啥mih學校</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">私立iah是公立</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kan-na ē記得你</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大力笑--過　大聲háu--過　認真活--過</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê青春tiānn tī hit个</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">暗淡ê半暝月</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">按怎lóng想bē到</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">平凡　快樂</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">細漢時　爸母簡單ê期待</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大漢了後　suah愈來愈複雜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">愈來愈沉重</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">成績　宿題　升學　是</span></p><blockquote style=\"border: none; margin: 0 0 0 40px; padding: 0px;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">揣無空縫喘khuì ê網</span></p></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">網碎你ê青春夢</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">自hit暝　開始落雨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮m̄知影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你hit爿kám有落雨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮kan-na知影&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hit暝ê雨　永遠落bē停</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5bY-wWvMHjjk0tUid2wHWOj0CJrLwvmUVn_BzyDM83hA_sCzk3GgX-pfD1915iCKqZxl7V6AQJ8jFcUQgAixHy4ZPQVcmIqgxHOZwT5zYX3dnKWUa-uUcodcFx37f0n7eY1-ocFFK2A5akSjxtTpO8Z9l_vQ2H5knTeUa7mv4I5HjoSf4lBQSYmebGA/s1421/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5bY-wWvMHjjk0tUid2wHWOj0CJrLwvmUVn_BzyDM83hA_sCzk3GgX-pfD1915iCKqZxl7V6AQJ8jFcUQgAixHy4ZPQVcmIqgxHOZwT5zYX3dnKWUa-uUcodcFx37f0n7eY1-ocFFK2A5akSjxtTpO8Z9l_vQ2H5knTeUa7mv4I5HjoSf4lBQSYmebGA/w450-h640/345%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_UPcmN22Vbo4kMo0V0U3Z0DHTGw3Lw2urzQGdQXHG6wKu5AEQKJJRYKFYiX4TMqSPSXBFN2tWdUQR7aJVRPPo-dzLGYLy-QWSRzj50dBdqVqlBmux5DHelMUtrjUw5r6sxOCQHmDPUUEaW81x_kJxXDIhqCKrAc9guW09XXNEFgTt1wniUpB6OrjaeA/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%816.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh_UPcmN22Vbo4kMo0V0U3Z0DHTGw3Lw2urzQGdQXHG6wKu5AEQKJJRYKFYiX4TMqSPSXBFN2tWdUQR7aJVRPPo-dzLGYLy-QWSRzj50dBdqVqlBmux5DHelMUtrjUw5r6sxOCQHmDPUUEaW81x_kJxXDIhqCKrAc9guW09XXNEFgTt1wniUpB6OrjaeA/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1345%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%816.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><div class=\"separ